From: linhart@topaz.rutgers.edu (Mike Threepoint)
Newsgroups: rec.games.hack,comp.sources.games.bugs
Subject: Fred Fish's termcap library, fixed
Summary: A corrected termcap.arc.uu.
Message-ID: <Aug.14.04.06.14.1989.11080@topaz.rutgers.edu>
Date: 14 Aug 89 08:06:16 GMT
Organization: Frobozz Magic Amulet of Yendor Company
Lines: 433

Some people have asked where they can termcap.arc without ftp'ing.
Some people have complained that when they got it, it left H's and j's
on their screens, or didn't compile under Turbo C.

Bandaging two wounds with one band-aid, i present you with a bugfixed
termcap library, arc'd and uuencoded.  Thankfully, Fred liberally
allows clearly documented changes to be distributed in his license.

begin 644 termcap.arc
